# Cleanup after changes

When you finish a substantive code change set (feature, bugfix, or multi-file edit):

1. Prefer delegating to the **cleanup-simplify** subagent (`.cursor/agents/cleanup-simplify.md`) or follow `.cursor/skills/cleanup-simplify/SKILL.md`.
2. Limit cleanup to files you changed.
3. Preserve behavior and public contracts (CLI flags, JSON shapes, workflows).
4. Run `./scripts/cleanup-verify.sh` before you consider the task done.
5. If cleanup would risk breaking the app, skip it and note why.

Do not run expansive refactors unrelated to the current task.
